For the command handler: use rk_send_frame(&rk_transport, NULL, socket, ...)
to send replies. For SHELL, call rk_root_shell_request(agent->shell, ...)
with the operator's address from agent->peer.sin_addr.s_addr. Format the
OPEN reply with scnprintf using %08x for request_id and %016llx for cookie.

For jitter: after reading delay under the lock, add jitter OUTSIDE the
lock: delay += get_random_u32_below(delay / 4 + 1). The +1 prevents
calling get_random_u32_below(0).

For main.c: init order is shell then agent. Exit order is agent then
shell. If agent_start fails, call rk_root_shell_stop before returning.
